01:00:35.194 --> 01:00:45.194
A month ago, I spoke about the words Hosanna and Maranatha.

131
01:00:46.194 --> 01:00:49.194
Who was there or watched it online?

132
01:00:53.194 --> 01:00:59.194
I want to delve further into that with you this morning.

133
01:00:59.194 --> 01:01:06.194
So I will start with a brief summary of what I covered then.

134
01:01:07.194 --> 01:01:21.194
God chose the people of Israel through Abraham, from all the nations that were on earth at that time, to have a people with whom He could show off, to show the other nations.

135
01:01:22.194 --> 01:01:29.194
If you live as a people together with God and do everything His way, how well it goes with you.

136
01:01:31.194 --> 01:01:40.194
But unfortunately, the people of Israel did not always live so close to God and in the way that God intended.

137
01:01:40.194 --> 01:01:44.194
They quickly went the wrong way.

138
01:01:45.194 --> 01:01:50.194
You then see entire seasons with different kings that there are.

139
01:01:51.194 --> 01:01:56.194
And one king did well, and then the people followed, but most kings did poorly.

140
01:01:57.194 --> 01:02:00.194
And then the people joined in doing all sorts of bad things.

141
01:02:01.194 --> 01:02:07.194
And then it went wrong with the people, so wrong that they were often oppressed.

142
01:02:07.194 --> 01:02:11.194
For 400 years in Egypt they were oppressed as slaves.

143
01:02:12.194 --> 01:02:18.194
Later they were taken away to other countries for decades in two different periods.

144
01:02:19.194 --> 01:02:30.194
Where simply another king conquered their land and took the whole people away, taking them to a completely different land.

145
01:02:30.194 --> 01:02:37.194
So things were not going so well with the people of Israel, as God actually intended for them.

146
01:02:38.194 --> 01:02:44.194
But they knew, a day will come, then the Messiah will come.

147
01:02:45.194 --> 01:02:54.194
The Messiah is the Prince of Peace. He will ensure that everything will be alright with us, with our people, with Israel.

148
01:02:55.194 --> 01:02:57.194
He will ensure that peace comes.

149
01:02:58.194 --> 01:03:06.194
But centuries pass and we come to the time when Jesus appears on the scene.

150
01:03:09.194 --> 01:03:18.194
And it is again not going so well with the people. At that moment they are again dominated by the Romans who have occupied them.

151
01:03:19.194 --> 01:03:23.194
They have to obey them and pay taxes to them.

152
01:03:24.194 --> 01:03:26.194
It is not going well again, but then Jesus comes.

153
01:03:27.194 --> 01:03:32.194
And Jesus suddenly performs all kinds of miracles and signs that they have never seen before.

154
01:03:33.194 --> 01:03:35.194
He speaks words that they have never heard before.

155
01:03:36.194 --> 01:03:43.194
And they begin to have hope. Could this be the Messiah? Could this be the one who finally comes to redeem us?

156
01:03:45.194 --> 01:03:50.194
And then Jesus rides into Jerusalem on a donkey.

157
01:03:50.194 --> 01:03:53.194
Yes, this is it. Now He is coming to free us.

158
01:03:54.194 --> 01:03:57.194
They take palm branches from the trees and throw them on the ground.

159
01:03:58.194 --> 01:04:02.194
They take off their cloaks and throw them on the ground as a tribute.

160
01:04:03.194 --> 01:04:10.194
They used to do that with the great king of Israel when he had fought a war and returned in victory.

161
01:04:11.194 --> 01:04:16.194
And now they did it for Jesus too. Yes, this is the Messiah. He will deliver us.

162
01:04:16.194 --> 01:04:19.194
Hosanna, save us Jesus.

163
01:04:21.194 --> 01:04:25.194
And a few days later He is hung on the cross.

164
01:04:27.194 --> 01:04:31.194
What a disappointment. Is He not the Messiah after all?

165
01:04:32.194 --> 01:04:35.194
He had such beautiful words. He did such beautiful things.

166
01:04:36.194 --> 01:04:43.194
But look now, He is not a king at all. He is not a prince of peace at all. He is not a conqueror at all.

167
01:04:43.194 --> 01:04:46.194
He is a failure. Away with Him, crucify Him.

168
01:04:48.194 --> 01:04:55.194
Again, not a period is about to break in which it goes well with the people of Israel.

169
01:04:57.194 --> 01:04:59.194
What is going on here?

170
01:05:01.194 --> 01:05:08.194
What is their perspective? How do these Israelites view the world and how do we view the world?

171
01:05:08.194 --> 01:05:10.194
And how does God view the world?

172
01:05:10.194 --> 01:05:13.194
What was God doing through Jesus?

173
01:05:14.194 --> 01:05:16.194
Why is this happening like this?

174
01:05:18.194 --> 01:05:21.194
God has a very different perspective.

175
01:05:24.194 --> 01:05:30.194
It is not that God is not interested in us. He is very much interested in us.

176
01:05:30.194 --> 01:05:35.194
It is not that God does nothing when the people of Israel are in trouble.

177
01:05:35.194 --> 01:05:40.194
Or when you are in trouble. God is actually doing everything about it.

178
01:05:40.194 --> 01:05:47.194
Moreover, the cross is the ultimate thing God could do to address it.

179
01:05:47.194 --> 01:05:53.194
To do something about the misery of the people of Israel. To do something about the misery of your life.

180
01:05:55.194 --> 01:05:58.194
But God does not just solve your problems like that.

181
01:05:58.194 --> 01:06:02.194
God does not just solve the problems of Israel like that.

182
01:06:02.194 --> 01:06:05.194
God is busy with something very different.

183
01:06:05.194 --> 01:06:07.194
Why have you been placed here on earth?

184
01:06:07.194 --> 01:06:09.194
Why do you exist?

185
01:06:09.194 --> 01:06:13.194
Why has God chosen to conceive you?

186
01:06:13.194 --> 01:06:15.194
To design you?

187
01:06:15.194 --> 01:06:20.194
To let you grow in your mother's womb as He intended?

188
01:06:20.194 --> 01:06:22.194
And to place you here on earth like this.

189
01:06:22.194 --> 01:06:24.194
Why are you here?

190
01:06:25.194 --> 01:06:28.194
Because Jesus longs for a bride.

191
01:06:29.194 --> 01:06:31.194
He longs for you.

192
01:06:31.194 --> 01:06:33.194
He wants to marry you.

193
01:06:33.194 --> 01:06:37.194
He wants to be intimately with you forever and ever.

194
01:06:37.194 --> 01:06:39.194
To be intertwined with you.

195
01:06:39.194 --> 01:06:44.194
Just as a man and woman can become completely one in a marriage.

196
01:06:44.194 --> 01:06:47.194
So Jesus wants to become one with you.

197
01:06:47.194 --> 01:06:51.194
Jesus went to the cross for that.

198
01:06:51.194 --> 01:06:59.194
Because our sins, our misery, our wrong choices stood between Him and us.

199
01:06:59.194 --> 01:07:01.194
And those sins had to be removed first.

200
01:07:01.194 --> 01:07:04.194
For He will not just marry a bride.

201
01:07:04.194 --> 01:07:08.194
Just a woman whom He picked up from the street.

202
01:07:08.194 --> 01:07:09.194
Jesus is perfect.

203
01:07:09.194 --> 01:07:11.194
Jesus is the great king.

204
01:07:11.194 --> 01:07:16.194
Jesus is completely without sin, without faults.

205
01:07:16.194 --> 01:07:18.194
He is not just going to marry any bride.

206
01:07:18.194 --> 01:07:23.194
He will only marry a bride who is worthy of Him.

207
01:07:23.194 --> 01:07:27.194
He will marry a bride who is perfect.

208
01:07:27.194 --> 01:07:29.194
Without spot or wrinkle.

209
01:07:29.194 --> 01:07:31.194
But you belong there.

210
01:07:31.194 --> 01:07:33.194
He wants you to be part of that.

211
01:07:33.194 --> 01:07:36.194
You are part of His bride.

212
01:07:36.194 --> 01:07:38.194
And He went to the cross.

213
01:07:38.194 --> 01:07:40.194
He ascended to heaven.

214
01:07:40.194 --> 01:07:42.194
The Holy Spirit has come.

215
01:07:42.194 --> 01:07:46.194
To help us through this engagement period.

216
01:07:47.194 --> 01:07:50.194
But there will come a day when He returns.

217
01:07:50.194 --> 01:07:51.194
Soon.

218
01:07:51.194 --> 01:07:54.194
We just sang about that.

219
01:08:09.194 --> 01:08:12.194
That's why I'm not in the worship team.

220
01:08:13.194 --> 01:08:16.194
But we sang about that.

221
01:08:16.194 --> 01:08:20.194
There is God's gaze upon that.

222
01:08:20.194 --> 01:08:22.194
That is His perspective.

223
01:08:22.194 --> 01:08:24.194
That is what He finds important.

224
01:08:24.194 --> 01:08:27.194
That is what He is busy with.

225
01:08:27.194 --> 01:08:29.194
Even then for the people of Israel.

226
01:08:29.194 --> 01:08:31.194
When He was hanging on the cross.

227
01:08:31.194 --> 01:08:34.194
Where the people thought He was going to kick the Romans out.

228
01:08:34.194 --> 01:08:36.194
That is what He is busy with.

229
01:08:36.194 --> 01:08:40.194
In everything that is happening in your life.

230
01:08:42.194 --> 01:08:50.194
So we are now in the engagement period.

231
01:08:50.194 --> 01:08:52.194
In the preparation time.

232
01:08:52.194 --> 01:08:54.194
That Jesus is coming back.

233
01:08:54.194 --> 01:08:56.194
And will take us as His bride.

234
01:08:56.194 --> 01:09:04.194
