You would be doing all sorts of things in that direction.

239
01:09:19.194 --> 01:09:21.194
And growing towards it.

240
01:09:21.194 --> 01:09:27.194
And that is why we live here for about eighty or a hundred years or whatever on earth.

241
01:09:27.194 --> 01:09:34.194
This time is meant for us to get to know Jesus.

242
01:09:34.194 --> 01:09:37.194
And that we grow towards Him.

243
01:09:37.194 --> 01:09:40.194
That we are increasingly occupied with Him.

244
01:09:40.194 --> 01:09:46.194
And increasingly become like His perfect bride.

245
01:09:46.194 --> 01:09:48.194
And that doesn't just happen.

246
01:09:48.194 --> 01:09:53.194
It requires quite a bit.

247
01:09:53.194 --> 01:09:59.194
Just like in an engagement period, you don't just do anything.

248
01:09:59.194 --> 01:10:01.194
You are very consciously engaged with it.

249
01:10:01.194 --> 01:10:03.194
You want to spend time together.

250
01:10:03.194 --> 01:10:05.194
You want to prepare everything.

251
01:10:05.194 --> 01:10:09.194
You want to buy a beautiful wedding dress.

252
01:10:09.194 --> 01:10:10.194
A nice suit.

253
01:10:10.194 --> 01:10:12.194
And you want to make everything perfect.

254
01:10:12.194 --> 01:10:14.194
And you want to prepare the celebration completely.

255
01:10:14.194 --> 01:10:17.194
That everything will be absolutely great.

256
01:10:17.194 --> 01:10:25.194
But above all, you must ensure that you yourself become completely perfect.

257
01:10:25.194 --> 01:10:27.194
Absolutely great.

258
01:10:27.194 --> 01:10:29.194
Because that is what Jesus deserves of His bride.

259
01:10:29.194 --> 01:10:32.194
We must be without spot or wrinkle.

260
01:10:32.194 --> 01:10:37.194
And that is why we go through various things in this earthly time.

261
01:10:37.194 --> 01:10:40.194
If we look in the Bible.

262
01:10:40.194 --> 01:10:42.194
I said it last time as well.

263
01:10:42.194 --> 01:10:47.194
Great men of God had wonderful success stories.

264
01:10:47.194 --> 01:10:49.194
But a lot happened before that.

265
01:10:49.194 --> 01:10:54.194
If you look at Joseph.

266
01:10:54.194 --> 01:10:58.194
He received the dream that everyone would bow before him.

267
01:10:58.194 --> 01:11:00.194
Even his own brother.

268
01:11:00.194 --> 01:11:01.194
Even his father.

269
01:11:01.194 --> 01:11:03.194
But what happens?

270
01:11:03.194 --> 01:11:06.194
His brothers sell him as a slave.

271
01:11:06.194 --> 01:11:08.194
And he spends 13 years in prison.

272
01:11:08.194 --> 01:11:10.194
How come?

273
01:11:10.194 --> 01:11:12.194
Where is that dream?

274
01:11:12.194 --> 01:11:14.194
What was that dream then?

275
01:11:14.194 --> 01:11:17.194
Why did God give him that dream?

276
01:11:17.194 --> 01:11:21.194
While he then has to go through such a difficult time.

277
01:11:21.194 --> 01:11:24.194
Or if you look at David.

278
01:11:24.194 --> 01:11:28.194
Anointed as king.

279
01:11:28.194 --> 01:11:30.194
As the successor of Saul.

280
01:11:30.194 --> 01:11:35.194
Then he is so persecuted by Saul that he has to flee for years.

281
01:11:35.194 --> 01:11:37.194
And must live in caves.

282
01:11:37.194 --> 01:11:40.194
Why? God had anointed him to become king after all.

283
01:11:40.194 --> 01:11:46.194
Can't God just set Salma aside and put David on the throne?

284
01:11:46.194 --> 01:11:48.194
But God is doing something very different.

285
01:11:48.194 --> 01:11:50.194
Why?

286
01:11:51.194 --> 01:11:53.194
Moses.

287
01:11:53.194 --> 01:12:00.194
Called to finally bring the people out of that misery of slavery after 400 years.

288
01:12:00.194 --> 01:12:02.194
And what happens?

289
01:12:02.194 --> 01:12:04.194
First, he must flee for 40 years.

290
01:12:04.194 --> 01:12:09.194
And then he is finally allowed after 40 years. Can you imagine it?

291
01:12:09.194 --> 01:12:11.194
After 40 years, God calls him.

292
01:12:11.194 --> 01:12:16.194
And he may go to the Pharaoh and take the people away.

293
01:12:17.194 --> 01:12:20.194
And then he must wander in the desert for another 40 years.

294
01:12:20.194 --> 01:12:24.194
And ultimately, Moses himself does not even enter the promised land.

295
01:12:24.194 --> 01:12:28.194
Why? What is God doing?

296
01:12:28.194 --> 01:12:30.194
And also in our lives.

297
01:12:30.194 --> 01:12:36.194
You may have become a Christian and think from now on everything will be wonderful, beautiful, and fine.

298
01:12:36.194 --> 01:12:38.194
And easy and fun.

299
01:12:38.194 --> 01:12:42.194
And God will take care of everything for me and God will bless me.

300
01:12:42.194 --> 01:12:44.194
Because that is what He has promised.

301
01:12:44.194 --> 01:12:49.194
And yes, some things are going well, but some things are not going so well.

302
01:12:49.194 --> 01:12:53.194
You also go through seasons where it is not easy at all.

303
01:12:53.194 --> 01:12:56.194
Where there is a struggle in your life.

304
01:12:56.194 --> 01:12:57.194
How come?

305
01:12:57.194 --> 01:13:02.194
God, Hosanna, help me, save me, I need you, resolve this.

306
01:13:02.194 --> 01:13:04.194
Why do I have to go through this?

307
01:13:04.194 --> 01:13:12.194
But you know, to become a perfect bride for Jesus, it is necessary that we go through struggles.

308
01:13:12.194 --> 01:13:14.194
That is the best way.

309
01:13:14.194 --> 01:13:16.194
We also sang that this morning.

310
01:13:16.194 --> 01:13:18.194
I will not sing it again.

311
01:13:18.194 --> 01:13:21.194
But we sang, your way is better.

312
01:13:21.194 --> 01:13:30.194
That way of having to go through struggles sometimes, through pleasant seasons and through difficult seasons, is necessary.

313
01:13:30.194 --> 01:13:35.194
Just like with training, if you want to become strong, you have to endure pain.

314
01:13:35.194 --> 01:13:37.194
It doesn't work any other way.

315
01:13:37.194 --> 01:13:44.194
You can't just sit on your couch and, I don't know, do nothing and then expect to get strong muscles.

316
01:13:44.194 --> 01:13:45.194
That's not how it works.

317
01:13:45.194 --> 01:13:47.194
You have to fight for that.

318
01:13:47.194 --> 01:13:49.194
It will cost you something.

319
01:13:49.194 --> 01:13:51.194
The Bible talks about purification.

320
01:13:51.194 --> 01:13:59.194
Gold must be melted in the fire so that impurities rise to the surface and can be scraped off, so that it becomes pure.

321
01:13:59.194 --> 01:14:03.194
You shouldn't let fruit trees grow wild and just see what comes of it.

322
01:14:03.194 --> 01:14:05.194
They need to be pruned every year.

323
01:14:05.194 --> 01:14:06.194
That hurts.

324
01:14:06.194 --> 01:14:10.194
Those branches are cut off, also from you then.

325
01:14:10.194 --> 01:14:11.194
And that hurts.

326
01:14:11.194 --> 01:14:17.194
But that ensures that you can become a perfect, beautiful fruit tree that bears fruit.

327
01:14:17.194 --> 01:14:22.194
And all of that because we need to change.

328
01:14:22.194 --> 01:14:24.194
That pride needs to go.

329
01:14:24.194 --> 01:14:26.194
That arrogance needs to go.

330
01:14:26.194 --> 01:14:29.194
That self-centeredness needs to go.

331
01:14:29.194 --> 01:14:30.194
And so on.

332
01:14:30.194 --> 01:14:32.194
Those sins need to go.

333
01:14:32.194 --> 01:14:33.194
We need to change.

334
01:14:33.194 --> 01:14:37.194
And because of that, God lets us go through things.

335
01:14:37.194 --> 01:14:43.194
Whether you want to call it that God brings it into your life when there are difficulties.

336
01:14:43.194 --> 01:14:47.194
Or that the devil does it, or that people do it, or that you do it yourself.

337
01:14:47.194 --> 01:14:49.194
I don't care.

338
01:14:49.194 --> 01:14:51.194
But God lets you go through seasons.

339
01:14:51.194 --> 01:14:53.194
Going through struggles.

340
01:14:53.194 --> 01:14:55.194
Not because He does nothing about it.

341
01:14:55.194 --> 01:15:00.194
Not because he doesn't love you, or care for you, or that he is indifferent.

342
01:15:00.194 --> 01:15:04.194
But because it is necessary for you to become his perfect bride.

343
01:15:06.194 --> 01:15:10.194
As Tim has repeatedly emphasized in recent weeks.

344
01:15:10.194 --> 01:15:14.194
Sanctification, cleansing, dedication.

345
01:15:14.194 --> 01:15:15.194
That is necessary.

346
01:15:15.194 --> 01:15:21.194
We must live our lives in preparation for the return of Jesus.

347
01:15:30.194 --> 01:15:39.194
When you are in love and you enter the engagement period and you want to get married.

348
01:15:39.194 --> 01:15:41.194
What do you do then?

349
01:15:41.194 --> 01:15:47.194
You need to spend a lot of time with your future husband or wife.

350
01:15:47.194 --> 01:15:49.194
You want that too, right?

351
01:15:49.194 --> 01:15:50.194
You are head over heels in love.

352
01:15:50.194 --> 01:15:55.194
You can't wait for the next evening or day when you can see each other again.

353
01:15:55.194 --> 01:16:01.194
To do nice things together, but especially to get to know each other better.

354
01:16:03.194 --> 01:16:09.194
What if you want to get married, but that will happen sometime later.

355
01:16:09.194 --> 01:16:11.194
That's not until a year from now.

356
01:16:11.194 --> 01:16:13.194
Don't be so strict about it.

357
01:16:13.194 --> 01:16:18.194
Instead of going to your friend, you go to someone else.

358
01:16:18.194 --> 01:16:22.194
Or you do something for yourself that you enjoy.

359
01:16:22.194 --> 01:16:23.194
That doesn't work, does it?

360
01:16:23.194 --> 01:16:28.194
You should be focused on getting to know each other better during your engagement period.

361
01:16:28.194 --> 01:16:30.194
To live towards that marriage.

362
01:16:31.194 --> 01:16:39.194
What if you go out a lot with your boyfriend or girlfriend, but you always take your friends along as well?

363
01:16:39.194 --> 01:16:41.194
Then you go to an amusement park again.

364
01:16:41.194 --> 01:16:42.194
Then you go out again.

365
01:16:42.194 --> 01:16:47.194
You are together with her, but there are always others around too.

366
01:16:47.194 --> 01:16:49.194
That won't work either.

367
01:16:49.194 --> 01:16:53.194
That's fine, but you also need to spend time just the two of you.

368
01:16:53.194 --> 01:16:56.194
Spend a lot of time just the two of you.

369
01:16:56.194 --> 01:16:58.194
Go to a little restaurant.

370
01:17:00.194 --> 01:17:03.194
Go for a walk on the beach.

371
01:17:06.194 --> 01:17:08.194
Talk a lot with each other.

372
01:17:09.194 --> 01:17:10.194
That is important.

373
01:17:10.194 --> 01:17:18.194
By the way, maybe in your life you want to marry someone.

374
01:17:18.194 --> 01:17:21.194
But for some reason, it doesn't work out.

375
01:17:21.194 --> 01:17:23.194
Or you don't find anyone.

376
01:17:23.194 --> 01:17:25.194
Or not yet anyone.

377
01:17:25.194 --> 01:17:27.194
You know, Jesus loves you.

378
01:17:27.194 --> 01:17:29.194
He is your bridegroom.

379
01:17:29.194 --> 01:17:32.194
And you will marry when you are with Jesus.

380
01:17:32.194 --> 01:17:36.194
Maybe not here on earth, but certainly in heaven.

381
01:17:36.194 --> 01:17:38.194
Jesus is your bridegroom.

382
01:17:39.194 --> 01:17:43.194
If you are only hanging out with your friends.

383
01:17:43.194 --> 01:17:45.194
Or if they are always there.

384
01:17:45.194 --> 01:17:47.194
You can never build intimacy.

385
01:17:47.194 --> 01:17:52.194
In the same way, it's a bit like that.

386
01:17:52.194 --> 01:17:55.194
If you come to church every Sunday.

387
01:17:55.194 --> 01:17:57.194
But during the week, you don't take it seriously.

388
01:17:57.194 --> 01:17:59.194
With your encounter with Jesus.

389
01:17:59.194 --> 01:18:01.194
With your intimacy with him.

390
01:18:01.194 --> 01:18:05.194
That's a bit like coming to church every week.

391
01:18:05.194 --> 01:18:08.194
Or it's a bit like being with your friends together.

392
01:18:08.194 --> 01:18:10.194
Going out with your girlfriends.

393
01:18:12.194 --> 01:18:17.194
But it's so important to be alone with her.

394
01:18:17.194 --> 01:18:20.194
And so it's also so important to be alone with Jesus.

395
01:18:20.194 --> 01:18:24.194
To be engaged with him every day during the week as well.

396
01:18:26.194 --> 01:18:28.194
Let's take a look.

397
01:18:28.194 --> 01:18:33.194
What Jesus says about all this.

398
01:18:33.194 --> 01:18:35.194
Let's grab the Bible.

399
01:18:35.194 --> 01:18:38.194
If you had already grabbed him during the collection.

400
01:18:38.194 --> 01:18:40.194
Then you're already in the right chapter.

401
01:18:40.194 --> 01:18:42.194
Matthew 6.

402
01:18:42.194 --> 01:18:46.194
But we will start reading from verse 6 now.

403
01:18:48.194 --> 01:18:50.194
So Matthew 6 verse 6.

404
01:19:03.194 --> 01:19:17.194
Here Jesus will explain how to get to know each other more intimately.

405
01:19:17.194 --> 01:19:19.194
How that works in his kingdom.

406
01:19:19.194 --> 01:19:22.194
But when you pray, says Jesus.

407
01:19:22.194 --> 01:19:25.194
Go into your room and shut the door.

408
01:19:27.194 --> 01:19:29.194
Very important.

409
01:19:30.194 --> 01:19:34.194
It is good to pray together in the church.

410
01:19:34.194 --> 01:19:37.194
It is good to pray in your family.

411
01:19:37.194 --> 01:19:43.194
But it is also very important to take time alone.

412
01:19:43.194 --> 01:19:45.194
To go to a separate place.

413
01:19:45.194 --> 01:19:49.194
Find a spot somewhere in the house.

414
01:19:49.194 --> 01:19:52.194
Where you can be alone with Jesus.

415
01:19:52.194 --> 01:19:54.194
Where you can fully focus on him.

416
01:19:54.194 --> 01:19:57.194
Just like it is important with a fiancé.

417
01:19:57.194 --> 01:20:00.194
That you spend time together alone.

418
01:20:00.194 --> 01:20:02.194
To get to know each other.

419
01:20:02.194 --> 01:20:05.194
It is also important that you alone you.

420
01:20:05.194 --> 01:20:07.194
Together with Jesus.

421
01:20:09.194 --> 01:20:12.194
In search of getting to know Jesus.

422
01:20:12.194 --> 01:20:15.194
So go into your room and shut the door.

423
01:20:15.194 --> 01:20:18.194
Then pray to the Father while no one sees it.

424
01:20:18.194 --> 01:20:21.194
And your Father who sees what is hidden.

425
01:20:21.194 --> 01:20:23.194
Will reward you openly.

426
01:20:23.194 --> 01:20:26.194
And when you pray, do not use a lot of words.

427
01:20:26.194 --> 01:20:28.194
By repeating the same thing over and over.

428
01:20:28.194 --> 01:20:30.194
As the other nations do.

429
01:20:30.194 --> 01:20:34.194
For they think that by their words being repeated.

430
01:20:34.194 --> 01:20:37.194
Their gods will do what they ask of them.

431
01:20:37.194 --> 01:20:39.194
Do not be like them.

432
01:20:39.194 --> 01:20:42.194
For your Father knows what you need already.

433
01:20:42.194 --> 01:20:46.194
He knows it before you have prayed for it.

434
01:20:46.194 --> 01:20:48.194
But pray the following.

435
01:20:49.194 --> 01:20:51.194
And now comes our Father.

436
01:20:51.194 --> 01:20:53.194
Father, you probably know this well.

437
01:20:53.194 --> 01:20:56.194
Is a very well-known prayer, of course.

438
01:20:57.194 --> 01:20:59.194
And then Jesus says.

439
01:21:00.194 --> 01:21:02.194
Our heavenly Father.

440
01:21:02.194 --> 01:21:04.194
Well, we can stop right there.

441
01:21:07.194 --> 01:21:11.194
He begins with a focus on God.

442
01:21:11.194 --> 01:21:14.194
You can be in your problems.

443
01:21:14.194 --> 01:21:18.194
And I do not want to deny that problems can be very intense.

444
01:21:18.194 --> 01:21:20.194
That they can be so intense.

445
01:21:20.194 --> 01:21:23.194
That you are fully focused on that.

446
01:21:23.194 --> 01:21:25.194
And you need to get out of those problems.

447
01:21:25.194 --> 01:21:26.194
And you are in that struggle.

448
01:21:26.194 --> 01:21:28.194
And how am I going to solve it?

449
01:21:28.194 --> 01:21:29.194
But do not go to God.

450
01:21:29.194 --> 01:21:31.194
And start right there.

451
01:21:31.194 --> 01:21:33.194
Lord this and that.

452
01:21:33.194 --> 01:21:35.194
And solve it.

453
01:21:35.194 --> 01:21:37.194
And how is that supposed to work?

454
01:21:37.194 --> 01:21:39.194
No, our Father.

455
01:21:41.194 --> 01:21:43.194
Why Father?

456
01:21:44.194 --> 01:21:47.194
Not just God.

457
01:21:47.194 --> 01:21:48.194
But Father.

458
01:21:48.194 --> 01:21:50.194
Jesus says Father.

459
01:21:50.194 --> 01:21:52.194
So we should pray like that.

460
01:21:52.194 --> 01:21:53.194
So He is also our Father.

461
01:21:53.194 --> 01:21:55.194
Of course, he is Jesus' Father.

462
01:21:55.194 --> 01:21:57.194
But he is also our Father.

463
01:21:57.194 --> 01:22:00.194
That is where intimacy begins right away.

464
01:22:00.194 --> 01:22:02.194
Do you see that?

465
01:22:02.194 --> 01:22:06.194
God does not just want us to pray.

466
01:22:06.194 --> 01:22:09.194
God is looking for us as his bride.

467
01:22:09.194 --> 01:22:10.194
He wants that intimacy.

468
01:22:10.194 --> 01:22:12.194
That's why Father.

469
01:22:12.194 --> 01:22:14.194
I always say daddy.

470
01:22:14.194 --> 01:22:16.194
In the beginning, that was difficult.

471
01:22:16.194 --> 01:22:18.194
Because you also have an earthly father.

472
01:22:18.194 --> 01:22:21.194
But I have learned to call him daddy.

473
01:22:21.194 --> 01:22:23.194
He is my daddy.

474
01:22:23.194 --> 01:22:25.194
A father.

475
01:22:25.194 --> 01:22:29.194
Unfortunately, there are many bad fathers.

476
01:22:29.194 --> 01:22:30.194
Moreover.

477
01:22:30.194 --> 01:22:32.194
Jesus said that we are all bad fathers.

478
01:22:32.194 --> 01:22:34.194
But a good father.

479
01:22:34.194 --> 01:22:36.194
That is your rock.

480
01:22:36.194 --> 01:22:37.194
You can build on that.

481
01:22:37.194 --> 01:22:38.194
You can trust in that.

482
01:22:38.194 --> 01:22:39.194
That protects you.

483
01:22:40.194 --> 01:22:42.194
That knows what you are going through.

484
01:22:42.194 --> 01:22:44.194
That gives you advice.

485
01:22:44.194 --> 01:22:46.194
That shows you the way.

486
01:22:46.194 --> 01:22:48.194
Our heavenly Father.

487
01:22:48.194 --> 01:22:51.194
This is how Jesus immediately begins to explain.

488
01:22:51.194 --> 01:22:53.194
When we are in that inner room.

489
01:22:53.194 --> 01:22:56.194
Our focus must be directed towards Jesus.

490
01:23:00.194 --> 01:23:03.194
Let all people have deep reverence for you.

491
01:23:03.194 --> 01:23:07.194
Immediately intercession.

492
01:23:08.194 --> 01:23:15.194
Immediately dive into God's perspective.

493
01:23:15.194 --> 01:23:17.194
This is important.

494
01:23:17.194 --> 01:23:19.194
This is what it is all about.

495
01:23:19.194 --> 01:23:21.194
That people come to know God.

496
01:23:21.194 --> 01:23:23.194
That they gain reverence for Him.

497
01:23:23.194 --> 01:23:25.194
That they live for Him.

498
01:23:31.194 --> 01:23:33.194
Let your kingdom come.

499
01:23:33.194 --> 01:23:35.194
Your kingdom.

500
01:23:35.194 --> 01:23:37.194
Not the Romans out.

501
01:23:37.194 --> 01:23:39.194
Not your problems out.

502
01:23:39.194 --> 01:23:42.194
God's kingdom to come in your life.

503
01:23:42.194 --> 01:23:44.194
And in the Kempen.

504
01:23:44.194 --> 01:23:48.194
Let what you want be done on earth, let it be done in the Kempen.

505
01:23:48.194 --> 01:23:51.194
Just as what you want is done in heaven.

506
01:23:51.194 --> 01:23:54.194
Do you see how that perspective is at work here?

507
01:23:54.194 --> 01:23:56.194
Here we are praying.

508
01:23:56.194 --> 01:23:57.194
Here Jesus says.

509
01:23:57.194 --> 01:24:00.194
We need to pray for what really matters.

510
01:24:00.194 --> 01:24:02.194
What is truly important.

511
01:24:02.194 --> 01:24:04.194
That God's kingdom comes.

512
01:24:04.194 --> 01:24:07.194
That the earth will be as God wants it.

513
01:24:07.194 --> 01:24:10.194
And not just to take our problems out for a moment.

514
01:24:10.194 --> 01:24:12.194
And then live comfortably again.

515
01:24:12.194 --> 01:24:14.194
No, that we are engaged with God.

516
01:24:14.194 --> 01:24:17.194
That we are living towards Him.

517
01:24:18.194 --> 01:24:20.194
And only then.

518
01:24:21.194 --> 01:24:25.194
Shall we talk about our needs and problems.

519
01:24:28.194 --> 01:24:31.194
Give us today the food we need.

520
01:24:31.194 --> 01:24:34.194
Of course, it's not just about food.

521
01:24:34.194 --> 01:24:37.194
That is a very intense prayer in some countries.

522
01:24:37.194 --> 01:24:40.194
In our countries, that means nothing.

523
01:24:40.194 --> 01:24:43.194
But it is, of course, about all our needs.

524
01:24:43.194 --> 01:24:45.194
Everything we need.

525
01:24:45.194 --> 01:24:47.194
The solving of our problems.

526
01:24:47.194 --> 01:24:49.194
The things we struggle with.

527
01:24:49.194 --> 01:24:52.194
Things we cannot solve ourselves.

528
01:24:52.194 --> 01:24:55.194
Then there is time to bring that to Jesus.

529
01:24:55.194 --> 01:24:57.194
So it's not that it shouldn't be done.

530
01:24:57.194 --> 01:24:59.194
But it must have the right place.

531
01:24:59.194 --> 01:25:01.194
First focused on God.

532
01:25:01.194 --> 01:25:03.194
First on His interest and His perspective.

533
01:25:03.194 --> 01:25:06.194
And then you come to your own things.

534
01:25:06.194 --> 01:25:09.194
Forgive us what we do wrong.

535
01:25:09.194 --> 01:25:14.194
Just as we forgive the people who wrong us.

536
01:25:17.194 --> 01:25:21.194
There you can preach in itself about forgiveness.

537
01:25:21.194 --> 01:25:26.194
But Jesus does include it in this example prayer.

538
01:25:27.194 --> 01:25:31.194
So the realization of Lord, I need You.

539
01:25:31.194 --> 01:25:34.194
I am a sinner, I do things wrong.

540
01:25:34.194 --> 01:25:37.194
Sorry Lord, forgive me.

541
01:25:37.194 --> 01:25:40.194
That is super important to pray that often.

542
01:25:40.194 --> 01:25:46.194
Then the focus is on you becoming His beautiful bride.

543
01:25:46.194 --> 01:25:49.194
Instead of God having to solve your problems.

544
01:25:52.194 --> 01:25:55.194
And then also the reminder for ourselves.

545
01:25:55.194 --> 01:25:57.194
We must also forgive others.

546
01:25:57.194 --> 01:26:01.194
Just as important, otherwise God cannot forgive us either.

547
01:26:03.194 --> 01:26:07.194
And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil.

548
01:26:07.194 --> 01:26:12.194
That is again a cry for Lord, I am in that struggle, help me.

549
01:26:12.194 --> 01:26:14.194
You can definitely pray for that.

550
01:26:14.194 --> 01:26:17.194
I will give some examples for that.

551
01:26:17.194 --> 01:26:20.194
But in the right context and in the right place.

552
01:26:20.194 --> 01:26:23.194
And then you end with for.

553
01:26:23.194 --> 01:26:25.194
Yours is the kingdom.

554
01:26:25.194 --> 01:26:31.194
And all power and all might and all heavenly majesty forever.

555
01:26:31.194 --> 01:26:33.194
Amen, so it is.

556
01:26:33.194 --> 01:26:37.194
Then you close again with that Maranatha cry to God.

557
01:26:37.194 --> 01:26:40.194
It’s all about You, You are amazing.

558
01:26:41.194 --> 01:26:45.194
I will give an example to help you.

559
01:26:45.194 --> 01:26:53.194
For this prayer of our Father was never meant by Jesus to be recited like a chant.

560
01:26:53.194 --> 01:26:59.194
It is a kind of coat rack, an example prayer.

561
01:26:59.194 --> 01:27:04.194
A model of how you should set up your prayer.

562
01:27:04.194 --> 01:27:10.194
And I want to talk about that struggle you might be facing in the context of this sermon.

563
01:27:15.194 --> 01:27:19.194
So that is the middle part of the prayer.

564
01:27:21.194 --> 01:27:26.194
Imagine that you are struggling with a prayer.

565
01:27:26.194 --> 01:27:29.194
And you are a prayer.

566
01:27:30.194 --> 01:27:39.194
Imagine that you are struggling with, what should I take?

567
01:27:43.194 --> 01:27:46.194
With inner turmoil and anger.

568
01:27:46.194 --> 01:27:51.194
People have done something to you, you know what they have done to you.

569
01:27:51.194 --> 01:27:54.194
You know what kind of jerks they are.

570
01:27:55.194 --> 01:28:00.194
You are angry and you keep struggling with it and thinking about it.

571
01:28:00.194 --> 01:28:03.194
And that other person needs to change.

572
01:28:03.194 --> 01:28:05.194
And you can go to God.

573
01:28:05.194 --> 01:28:08.194
Lord, that person, what an idiot.

574
01:28:08.194 --> 01:28:11.194
And do you know what all he has done?

575
01:28:11.194 --> 01:28:14.194
And does he want to change? And change that man.

576
01:28:14.194 --> 01:28:18.194
Or get rid of him or whatever. I don't want to see him in my life anymore.

577
01:28:18.194 --> 01:28:21.194
God, fix this, because this is not going well.

578
01:28:21.194 --> 01:28:26.194
That's not how you should pray. So how should you?

579
01:28:26.194 --> 01:28:31.194
It is very important that you keep the Bible in mind.

580
01:28:31.194 --> 01:28:36.194
And okay, you know very well that you need to forgive.

581
01:28:36.194 --> 01:28:38.194
We have just dealt with that, mind you.

582
01:28:38.194 --> 01:28:42.194
And you often hear that, it will often come up in the church.

583
01:28:42.194 --> 01:28:44.194
So you know how to forgive.

584
01:28:44.194 --> 01:28:50.194
But yes, you might also know a few Bible verses that speak about forgiveness.

585
01:28:50.194 --> 01:28:55.194
But it is very important not only to know what the Bible says.

586
01:28:55.194 --> 01:28:57.194
But also to engage with it.

587
01:28:57.194 --> 01:29:00.194
Together with Jesus and to live it out.

588
01:29:00.194 --> 01:29:05.194
And this is an example. It can also be about your financial problems.

589
01:29:05.194 --> 01:29:09.194
Or your sexual struggles or whatever you are going through.

590
01:29:09.194 --> 01:29:13.194
But when you are going through something, when you are struggling with something.

591
01:29:13.194 --> 01:29:17.194
In your quiet time or as preparation.

592
01:29:18.194 --> 01:29:22.194
Then go searching in the Bible about your problem.

593
01:29:22.194 --> 01:29:26.194
So in this case, realize that you need forgiveness.

594
01:29:26.194 --> 01:29:30.194
But you can't do it, because it's such a little point, point, point.

595
01:29:30.194 --> 01:29:36.194
Then go search in the Bible what the Bible says about forgiveness.

596
01:29:36.194 --> 01:29:39.194
And there are all kinds of ways you can do that.

597
01:29:39.194 --> 01:29:45.194
But I personally always just do it by googling on the internet.

598
01:29:45.194 --> 01:29:53.194
And then I always type in Bible verse or Bible verses space forgiveness.

599
01:29:53.194 --> 01:29:58.194
Or you search what does the Bible say about forgiveness or something like that.

600
01:29:58.194 --> 01:30:00.194
It doesn't really matter.

601
01:30:00.194 --> 01:30:05.194
But it is important that you ask what the Bible says about it, of course.

602
01:30:05.194 --> 01:30:07.194
Or which Bible verses are about it.

603
01:30:08.194 --> 01:30:12.194
Then you quickly find sites that, for example, state...

604
01:30:12.194 --> 01:30:15.194
...a hundred verses about forgiveness.

605
01:30:15.194 --> 01:30:17.194
Well, those are really great sites.

606
01:30:17.194 --> 01:30:23.194
Open those and see what Bible texts are about forgiveness.

607
01:30:24.194 --> 01:30:28.194
Okay, when you start googling, all sorts of things come up.

608
01:30:28.194 --> 01:30:33.194
Then there are sermons and all kinds of explanations, pieces of text...

609
01:30:33.194 --> 01:30:36.194
...from people who have an opinion about it.

610
01:30:36.194 --> 01:30:39.194
And you have to be very careful with that.

611
01:30:39.194 --> 01:30:43.194
Because the goal is that you engage with the Bible...

612
01:30:43.194 --> 01:30:46.194
...about what the Bible says regarding your problem.

613
01:30:46.194 --> 01:30:51.194
And not what wonderfully beautiful opinions people have about it all.

614
01:30:51.194 --> 01:30:56.194
I'm not saying you shouldn't look at that, but be careful with it.

615
01:30:56.194 --> 01:31:00.194
In principle, you should have enough with the Bible...

616
01:31:00.194 --> 01:31:03.194
...and with what we teach here in the church.

617
01:31:03.194 --> 01:31:09.194
So don't fall into the trap of...

618
01:31:09.194 --> 01:31:13.194
...diving into all those opinions of people...

619
01:31:13.194 --> 01:31:16.194
...but look for those lists of Bible verses.

620
01:31:16.194 --> 01:31:19.194
Then look up such a verse in the Bible.

621
01:31:19.194 --> 01:31:23.194
For example, about forgiveness I have found...

622
01:31:25.194 --> 01:31:27.194
...where am I?

623
01:31:34.194 --> 01:31:37.194
Luke 6, verse 37.

624
01:31:37.194 --> 01:31:41.194
Do not judge anyone, and you will not be judged.

625
01:31:41.194 --> 01:31:45.194
Do not condemn anyone, and you will not be condemned.

626
01:31:45.194 --> 01:31:48.194
Let go, for then you will also be let go.

627
01:31:49.194 --> 01:31:51.194
Intense text.

628
01:31:51.194 --> 01:31:54.194
Then you sit there with your bitterness and your anger towards that person...

629
01:31:54.194 --> 01:31:57.194
...and then God says, just let it go.

630
01:31:57.194 --> 01:32:00.194
Yes, easy to say, Jesus.

631
01:32:01.194 --> 01:32:04.194
Then take the context into account.

632
01:32:04.194 --> 01:32:07.194
Never just take a verse on its own...

633
01:32:07.194 --> 01:32:11.194
...and pick a few cherries from the pie...

634
01:32:11.194 --> 01:32:14.194
...but also look at what comes before and after.

635
01:32:14.194 --> 01:32:18.194
In this case, if we look a little before, it says...

636
01:32:18.194 --> 01:32:21.194
...Jesus said, listen to what I am saying.

637
01:32:21.194 --> 01:32:24.194
Love your enemies and do good to those who hate you.

638
01:32:24.194 --> 01:32:26.194
Bless those who curse you...

639
01:32:26.194 --> 01:32:29.194
...and pray for those who mistreat you.

640
01:32:30.194 --> 01:32:33.194
Does that relate to your bitterness? Yes.

641
01:32:33.194 --> 01:32:38.194
If someone strikes you on your left cheek, turn your right cheek toward him as well.

642
01:32:38.194 --> 01:32:42.194
If someone takes your cloak, give him your shirt as well.

643
01:32:42.194 --> 01:32:48.194
And after the verse stands, no, love your enemies and do good to them.

644
01:32:48.194 --> 01:32:52.194
Lend something without expecting to get it back.

645
01:32:52.194 --> 01:32:56.194
Then you will receive a great reward and be a child of the Most High God.

646
01:32:56.194 --> 01:33:01.194
For he is also good to the ungrateful and wicked people.

647
01:33:01.194 --> 01:33:04.194
Be kind, just as your Father is kind.

648
01:33:04.194 --> 01:33:08.194
Do not judge anyone, then you will not be judged either.

649
01:33:08.194 --> 01:33:11.194
Do not condemn anyone, then you will not be condemned either.

650
01:33:11.194 --> 01:33:14.194
Let go, then you will also be let go.

651
01:33:18.194 --> 01:33:23.194
And so you will find many more verses like this.

652
01:33:23.194 --> 01:33:27.194
So you have plenty of material in the Bible for your problem.

653
01:33:27.194 --> 01:33:32.194
But do not just read it, for now comes the crucial part.

654
01:33:32.194 --> 01:33:36.194
Talk to God about it.

655
01:33:36.194 --> 01:33:40.194
So it is not so much about what you know is in the Bible,

656
01:33:40.194 --> 01:33:42.194
or that you have looked it up.

657
01:33:42.194 --> 01:33:49.194
The purpose of all that struggle of Jesus is to bring you closer to him.

658
01:33:49.194 --> 01:33:52.194
To change you into that perfect bride.

659
01:33:52.194 --> 01:33:55.194
For that, it is necessary that we do not just gain knowledge,

660
01:33:55.194 --> 01:33:58.194
it is necessary that we are in intimacy,

661
01:33:58.194 --> 01:34:01.194
in the solitude with Jesus, in the inner room,

662
01:34:01.194 --> 01:34:04.194
going through the struggle with Him.

663
01:34:04.194 --> 01:34:07.194
Do not shy away from the difficult season and the struggle,

664
01:34:07.194 --> 01:34:12.194
but take the Bible and talk to Jesus about it.

665
01:34:13.194 --> 01:34:19.194
So then, just be yourself with Jesus.

666
01:34:19.194 --> 01:34:21.194
Just be open.

667
01:34:21.194 --> 01:34:26.194
If you are angry with someone, tell it to Jesus.

668
01:34:26.194 --> 01:34:29.194
If you are angry with Jesus, tell it to Jesus.

669
01:34:29.194 --> 01:34:33.194
If you are in the struggle of why are you not doing anything,

670
01:34:33.194 --> 01:34:35.194
why must I go through this season?

671
01:34:35.194 --> 01:34:37.194
Talk to Jesus about it.

672
01:34:37.194 --> 01:34:39.194
Just say it to Jesus.

673
01:34:39.194 --> 01:34:42.194
Jesus, I don't understand anything at all.

674
01:34:42.194 --> 01:34:45.194
I don't like it at all, I find it terrible.

675
01:34:45.194 --> 01:34:46.194
How am I supposed to live like this?

676
01:34:46.194 --> 01:34:49.194
Are you really a good Father to me?

677
01:34:49.194 --> 01:34:51.194
Help me, Lord.

678
01:34:51.194 --> 01:34:53.194
Show me the way.

679
01:34:53.194 --> 01:34:55.194
Talk to Jesus like this.

680
01:34:55.194 --> 01:34:56.194
Really.

681
01:34:56.194 --> 01:34:59.194
So you do it like this during your engagement, getting to know each other.

682
01:34:59.194 --> 01:35:02.194
If you have an argument once, you don't just...

683
01:35:02.194 --> 01:35:04.194
Yes, you don't just say...

684
01:35:04.194 --> 01:35:07.194
If you have an argument once, you don't just...

685
01:35:07.194 --> 01:35:10.194
Yes, you have a bit of a tendency to walk away for a moment.

686
01:35:10.194 --> 01:35:13.194
But you need to come together and talk it out.

687
01:35:13.194 --> 01:35:16.194
You should also talk it out with Jesus.

688
01:35:16.194 --> 01:35:20.194
You need to go through that intimacy, in that inner room, through that struggle.

689
01:35:20.194 --> 01:35:23.194
Talk to Him about your things.

690
01:35:23.194 --> 01:35:26.194
And then take those Bible verses and say...

691
01:35:26.194 --> 01:35:31.194
Lord, you say that I must forgive my enemies and be good to them.

692
01:35:31.194 --> 01:35:33.194
But he is such an idiot.

693
01:35:33.194 --> 01:35:36.194
Must I do that? I can't do that at all.

694
01:35:36.194 --> 01:35:39.194
Yes, that's how you should just talk to Jesus.

695
01:35:39.194 --> 01:35:43.194
That's how you talk to your wife or your husband or your friend or whatever.

696
01:35:43.194 --> 01:35:45.194
Talk to Jesus like that too.

697
01:35:45.194 --> 01:35:48.194
Just be real. Very important.

698
01:35:48.194 --> 01:35:52.194
You can't play hide and seek with Him.

699
01:35:52.194 --> 01:35:54.194
And take... Say that then.

700
01:35:54.194 --> 01:35:57.194
Lord, you say it in your Word and I actually understand it too,

701
01:35:57.194 --> 01:36:01.194
that it works that way or that it must be that way, but I cannot, Lord.

702
01:36:01.194 --> 01:36:03.194
For it is so difficult.

703
01:36:03.194 --> 01:36:05.194
It is so difficult, Lord.

704
01:36:05.194 --> 01:36:06.194
Help me.

705
01:36:06.194 --> 01:36:09.194
Forgive me for getting it wrong again and again.

706
01:36:09.194 --> 01:36:10.194
And help me.

707
01:36:10.194 --> 01:36:14.194
And fill me with your spirit and Holy Spirit guide me.

708
01:36:14.194 --> 01:36:18.194
And help me to love people as you love people.

709
01:36:18.194 --> 01:36:23.194
Help me to love that man as you love him.

710
01:36:23.194 --> 01:36:28.194
Lord, I don't feel it and I don't want it, but I do it anyway,

711
01:36:28.194 --> 01:36:29.194
for you want it, Lord.

712
01:36:29.194 --> 01:36:33.194
Forgive that man. I forgive that man in Jesus' name.

713
01:36:33.194 --> 01:36:36.194
And then it may still not be resolved for a long time.

714
01:36:36.194 --> 01:36:39.194
Maybe you have to go through such a struggle for years.

715
01:36:39.194 --> 01:36:42.194
But go through it together with God.

716
01:36:44.194 --> 01:36:46.194
One more example.

717
01:36:47.194 --> 01:36:49.194
And then we will conclude.

718
01:36:51.194 --> 01:36:56.194
Tim has been getting a lot of questions about Israel lately.

719
01:36:56.194 --> 01:37:00.194
How can it be that you as a congregation stand behind Israel,

720
01:37:00.194 --> 01:37:04.194
while they are making such a mess of things at the moment?

721
01:37:07.194 --> 01:37:10.194
So you can be in that struggle.

722
01:37:10.194 --> 01:37:13.194
Israel is something you constantly encounter in the Bible.

723
01:37:13.194 --> 01:37:15.194
The Bible says a lot about it.

724
01:37:15.194 --> 01:37:18.194
It is God's people, and so on, and so forth.

725
01:37:18.194 --> 01:37:21.194
So you can find yourself in a struggle as a Christian.

726
01:37:21.194 --> 01:37:25.194
Yes, but look at what they are doing in Gaza.

727
01:37:25.194 --> 01:37:28.194
Lord, I don't understand anything about it.

728
01:37:28.194 --> 01:37:31.194
That can't be from you, can it? That can't be good, can it?

729
01:37:31.194 --> 01:37:34.194
And you can form your opinion. You can participate in politics.

730
01:37:34.194 --> 01:37:37.194
Because I believe that this needs to happen in Israel.

731
01:37:37.194 --> 01:37:41.194
I believe that this needs to happen in Gaza.

732
01:37:41.194 --> 01:37:46.194
But what is God doing? What is God's perspective?

733
01:37:46.194 --> 01:37:49.194
We've already had a whole sermon about that.

734
01:37:49.194 --> 01:37:52.194
What is God's perspective? What is God working on?

735
01:37:52.194 --> 01:37:55.194
What is it all about in Israel?

736
01:37:55.194 --> 01:37:59.194
So then you start searching again, in Google for example.

737
01:37:59.194 --> 01:38:06.194
And then, okay, if you search for Israel, you get a hundred thousand mentions.

738
01:38:08.194 --> 01:38:12.194
So what I do then is, I want something from the New Testament.

739
01:38:12.194 --> 01:38:17.194
Something current, or at least from around the time of Jesus.

740
01:38:18.194 --> 01:38:23.194
So then you search for, for example, Bible verse Israel New Testament.

741
01:38:23.194 --> 01:38:26.194
And then you find, for example, this.

742
01:38:26.194 --> 01:38:33.194
In Romans 10 verse 1, Paul says.

743
01:38:33.194 --> 01:38:40.194
Brothers and sisters, with all my heart I pray to God that Israel would be saved.

744
01:38:40.194 --> 01:38:43.194
For that is what I long for with all my heart.

745
01:38:43.194 --> 01:38:47.194
For I know that they are trying very hard to serve God.

746
01:38:47.194 --> 01:38:49.194
But they are doing it the wrong way.

747
01:38:49.194 --> 01:38:54.194
For they do not understand how God wants to declare them free from their guilt.

748
01:38:54.194 --> 01:38:58.194
They are trying to do it in their own way through the things they do.

749
01:38:58.194 --> 01:39:01.194
As a result, they are not obedient to God.

750
01:39:01.194 --> 01:39:04.194
For God's way is Jesus.

751
01:39:04.194 --> 01:39:08.194
Jesus is the end goal of the law of Moses.

752
01:39:08.194 --> 01:39:12.194
Everyone who believes in him is declared free from guilt.

753
01:39:12.194 --> 01:39:19.194
And instead of forming all kinds of opinions.

754
01:39:19.194 --> 01:39:24.194
And getting involved in politics about how everything should proceed in Israel.

755
01:39:24.194 --> 01:39:31.194
We should be focused, just like Paul, on what God is focused on for Israel.

756
01:39:31.194 --> 01:39:33.194
It is still His people.

757
01:39:33.194 --> 01:39:36.194
He does not take back His promises.

758
01:39:36.194 --> 01:39:40.194
But they do not understand. They have strayed so far away from Him again.

759
01:39:40.194 --> 01:39:45.194
And perhaps God will let everything go wrong for Israel, as has often happened.

760
01:39:45.194 --> 01:39:51.194
Or perhaps God will lead them through a season in which they do have victory.

761
01:39:51.194 --> 01:39:55.194
And that they can live a piece of peace.

762
01:39:55.194 --> 01:39:58.194
We do not know that. We do not know what God is doing.

763
01:39:58.194 --> 01:40:00.194
But that is not necessary at all.

764
01:40:00.194 --> 01:40:04.194
For we still have a very important role for Israel.

765
01:40:04.194 --> 01:40:06.194
Namely to pray.

766
01:40:06.194 --> 01:40:08.194
They need to find Jesus.

767
01:40:08.194 --> 01:40:11.194
They are just as good as we are.

768
01:40:11.194 --> 01:40:16.194
And the people from Kempen, the Dutch, and the Belgians, and wherever you come from.

769
01:40:16.194 --> 01:40:18.194
Everyone needs to find Jesus.

770
01:40:18.194 --> 01:40:21.194
And that must be our prayer.

771
01:40:21.194 --> 01:40:25.194
So then you pray with Paul here.

772
01:40:25.194 --> 01:40:27.194
God, they do not understand it.

773
01:40:27.194 --> 01:40:32.194
They are trying their best, but they have missed you as their Messiah.

774
01:40:32.194 --> 01:40:35.194
Help them.

775
01:40:36.194 --> 01:40:42.194
That is why we talk about Israel. We empathize with them.

776
01:40:42.194 --> 01:40:47.194
It is not that we are for or against the war or what they are doing.

777
01:40:47.194 --> 01:40:49.194
That is not what it is about at all.

778
01:40:49.194 --> 01:40:51.194
It is about us fighting for them.

779
01:40:51.194 --> 01:40:54.194
Jesus is fighting for you as high priest.

780
01:40:54.194 --> 01:40:58.194
Jesus is fighting for his people Israel as high priest.

781
01:40:59.194 --> 01:41:05.194
We must stand by his side and fight with her for the Kempen and for Israel.

782
01:41:08.194 --> 01:41:10.194
We are going to conclude.

783
01:41:13.194 --> 01:41:21.194
Imagine a bride who is so in love.

784
01:41:21.194 --> 01:41:24.194
Who is so looking forward.

785
01:41:25.194 --> 01:41:28.194
That the day finally comes.

786
01:41:28.194 --> 01:41:29.194
That she is going to marry.

787
01:41:29.194 --> 01:41:31.194
That her groom comes.

788
01:41:31.194 --> 01:41:32.194
Her beloved.

789
01:41:32.194 --> 01:41:33.194
Her everything.

790
01:41:33.194 --> 01:41:36.194
Her whole hope and her future.

791
01:41:36.194 --> 01:41:40.194
What she wants to spend all her time with for the rest of her life.

792
01:41:40.194 --> 01:41:42.194
And she longs so much for that day.

793
01:41:42.194 --> 01:41:44.194
She looks forward to it so much.

794
01:41:45.194 --> 01:41:48.194
Will we be such a bride for Jesus?

795
01:41:49.194 --> 01:41:53.194
Will we live towards him?

796
01:41:53.194 --> 01:41:54.194
Every day.

797
01:41:54.194 --> 01:41:55.194
Not just on Sunday.

798
01:41:55.194 --> 01:41:57.194
But every day of the week.

799
01:41:57.194 --> 01:41:59.194
Being busy with him.

800
01:41:59.194 --> 01:42:00.194
Going in search of him.

801
01:42:00.194 --> 01:42:03.194
Entering into intimacy with Him.

802
01:42:03.194 --> 01:42:07.194
Not just focused on our own struggles.

803
01:42:07.194 --> 01:42:09.194
And always just talking about them with Him.

804
01:42:09.194 --> 01:42:11.194
And holding out our hand.

805
01:42:11.194 --> 01:42:13.194
Because here I solve my problem.

806
01:42:13.194 --> 01:42:16.194
Or shall we long for Him and say.

807
01:42:16.194 --> 01:42:18.194
Jesus, you are so awesome.

808
01:42:18.194 --> 01:42:21.194
I want to be awesome for you too.

809
01:42:21.194 --> 01:42:24.194
Forgive me for making such a mess of things.

810
01:42:24.194 --> 01:42:28.194
Lord, I am in that struggle.

811
01:42:28.194 --> 01:42:31.194
I don't want to sin, but it goes wrong again.

812
01:42:31.194 --> 01:42:32.194
But forgive me, Lord.

813
01:42:32.194 --> 01:42:34.194
For you are so worthy.

814
01:42:34.194 --> 01:42:37.194
A beautiful, lovely bride without spot or wrinkle.

815
01:42:37.194 --> 01:42:39.194
Make me like that, Lord.

816
01:42:39.194 --> 01:42:40.194
Help me.

817
01:42:40.194 --> 01:42:42.194
Lord, you are so beautiful.

818
01:42:42.194 --> 01:42:43.194
You are so good.

819
01:42:43.194 --> 01:42:44.194
You are so great.

820
01:42:44.194 --> 01:42:45.194
You are so loving.

821
01:42:45.194 --> 01:42:47.194
I long for You.

822
01:42:47.194 --> 01:42:49.194
Come quickly, Jesus.

823
01:43:42.194 --> 01:43:45.194
From day to night, day to morning.

824
01:43:45.194 --> 01:43:49.194
Let the varlawijn rise.

825
01:43:49.194 --> 01:43:53.194
From day to night, day to morning.

826
01:43:53.194 --> 01:43:57.194
Let the varlawijn rise.

827
01:43:57.194 --> 01:44:01.194
From day to night, day to morning.

828
01:44:01.194 --> 01:44:04.194
Let the varlawijn rise.

829
01:44:04.194 --> 01:44:08.194
From day to night, day to morning.

830
01:44:08.194 --> 01:44:12.194
Let the varlawijn rise.

831
01:44:12.194 --> 01:44:16.194
Let the varlawijn rise.

832
01:44:16.194 --> 01:44:20.194
Let the varlawijn rise.

833
01:44:20.194 --> 01:44:24.194
Let the varlawijn rise.

834
01:44:24.194 --> 01:44:32.194
I always find it so beautiful to see how God sends such a service.

835
01:44:33.194 --> 01:44:38.194
Then you have to open your eyes to want to see it, but that's why I say it too.

836
01:44:38.194 --> 01:44:45.194
The songs that have been chosen, that you want to sing God's praise day and night.

837
01:44:45.194 --> 01:44:52.194
The text that I had prepared at home, that I want to be in the house of God to learn from Him.

838
01:44:52.194 --> 01:45:01.194
And the word from Robert, which says that everything in life, everything can be found in the Bible.

839
01:45:01.194 --> 01:45:07.194
Everything from day and night you can learn from Jesus.

840
01:45:07.194 --> 01:45:13.194
Those are the sensitive things, like forgiveness, bitterness, and such matters.

841
01:45:13.194 --> 01:45:20.194
Or the struggles you are facing, but they are also just daily situations.

842
01:45:20.194 --> 01:45:25.194
Maybe your partner who has passed away, with whom you are struggling.

843
01:45:25.194 --> 01:45:28.194
Or that you cannot have children.

844
01:45:28.194 --> 01:45:31.194
All those things are in the Bible.

845
01:45:31.194 --> 01:45:37.194
And the Bible has an answer for everything.

846
01:45:37.194 --> 01:45:41.194
Why? Because Jesus loves us.

847
01:45:41.194 --> 01:45:44.194
And He is the answer.

848
01:45:44.194 --> 01:45:47.194
He is the way, the truth, and the life.

849
01:45:48.194 --> 01:45:50.194
The life.

850
01:45:50.194 --> 01:45:54.194
In big neon letters. The life.

851
01:45:54.194 --> 01:46:00.194
So everything we do in our life, He is the life.

852
01:46:00.194 --> 01:46:04.194
All issues in our life, He is the life.

853
01:46:04.194 --> 01:46:09.194
And that is why I want to conclude with the following prayer.

854
01:46:09.194 --> 01:46:12.194
Shall we, will you join me in prayer?

855
01:46:13.194 --> 01:46:15.194
Thank You Jesus.

856
01:46:15.194 --> 01:46:18.194
That You are the life.

857
01:46:18.194 --> 01:46:20.194
The truth.

858
01:46:20.194 --> 01:46:23.194
And my way.

859
01:46:23.194 --> 01:46:28.194
Where I go, whatever I experience in life, You are the answer.

860
01:46:28.194 --> 01:46:32.194
Your Word, the Bible, is the answer.

861
01:46:32.194 --> 01:46:36.194
And every day, day and night, I want to learn from You.

862
01:46:36.194 --> 01:46:42.194
I want to learn from You how I can navigate my way through life.

863
01:46:42.194 --> 01:46:45.194
Jesus, You are life.

864
01:46:45.194 --> 01:46:51.194
And I want to look to You as an example of how I can lead my life.

865
01:46:51.194 --> 01:46:56.194
This week here, I want to focus on those things.

866
01:46:56.194 --> 01:46:58.194
That You are life.

867
01:46:58.194 --> 01:47:01.194
That You give direction to my life.

868
